          },
          "mechanism": "Cancer causes chronic pain, driving opioid use. Cancer itself markedly increases thrombotic risk through multiple pathways (hypercoagulability, immobility, treatment effects).",
          "justification": "Cancer causes both exposure and outcome.",
          "role": "confounder",
          "proxy_for": null,
          "contestable": false
        },
        {
          "variable": {
            "kind": "variable",
