          },
          "mechanism": "CKD is associated with chronic pain and uremia (opioid use) and markedly increases DVT risk through uremic toxins, inflammation, and endothelial dysfunction.",
          "justification": "CKD causes both exposure and outcome.",
          "role": "confounder",
          "proxy_for": null,
          "contestable": false
        },
        {
