          },
          "mechanism": "Hypertension indicates underlying cardiovascular disease burden, which increases DVT risk through endothelial dysfunction and hemodynamic alterations; may be associated with pain conditions.",
          "justification": "Hypertension causes both exposure and outcome.",
          "role": "confounder",
          "proxy_for": null,
          "contestable": false
        },
        {
